#* {{quote-text|year=1987|author=Dave Roberts|title=Pipe and Excavation Contracting|page=173|url=http://books.google.com.au/books?id=SJxE3N8J6VsC&pg=PA173&dq=%22backhoe%7Cbackhoes%22+-intitle:%22backhoe%7Cbackhoes%22&hl=en&ei=ZnK-TsOuIKGfiAeYxPWFBQ&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q=%22backhoe%7Cbackhoes%22%20-intitle%3A%22backhoe%7Cbackhoes%22&f=false|passage=I'll recommend a good way to calculate '''backhoe''' production rates. Then we'll look at the two '''backhoes''' you'll be using, the wheeled '''backhoe''' and the tracked '''backhoe'''.}}
